  <p>Please consider using <a href="#llSetLinkPrimitiveParamsFast" target="_blank">llSetLinkPrimitiveParamsFast</a> in combination with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LINK_THIS" target="_blank">LINK_THIS</a> instead. You avoid the 0.2 second delay.</p>
  <p>Although it might not seem obvious you actually can set <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Link" target="_blank">link</a> <b>rules</b> using this function in combination with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_LINK_TARGET" target="_blank">PRIM_LINK_TARGET</a>, however <b>for your own sake</b> please use <a href="#llSetLinkPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetLinkPrimitiveParams</a> or <a href="#llSetLinkPrimitiveParamsFast" target="_blank">llSetLinkPrimitiveParamsFast</a> instead.</p>
