        <td>refers to the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Link#Root_Prim" target="_blank">root</a> prim in a multi-prim linked set[[1]](#footnote_1)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LINK_SET" target="_blank">LINK_SET</a></td>
